WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.920
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:44.000 --> 01:44.840
Of course…

01:46.360 --> 01:47.200
and you, too.

02:17.040 --> 02:18.200
Peiyi.

02:20.920 --> 02:22.560
How do you think Father

02:23.280 --> 02:24.600
will treat me?

02:26.520 --> 02:28.160
Like he's gotten me back,

02:29.040 --> 02:32.080
or will he hate having a rude,
unfilial daughter like me?

02:36.000 --> 02:37.240
His Majesty is gracious and merciful.

02:38.200 --> 02:40.560
No matter what, you're still his daughter.

02:57.440 --> 02:59.800
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

03:04.000 --> 03:06.440
Your Ladyship.
Inspector Du wants to see you.

03:07.600 --> 03:09.760
- I'm not in the mood.
- Your Ladyship, you should go.

03:09.840 --> 03:12.640
I haven't seen him that scary in ages.

03:26.960 --> 03:28.200
Why are you kneeling?

03:29.000 --> 03:31.800
Master, you called for me.
It must be because I messed up.

03:32.960 --> 03:34.040
What did you do wrong?

03:35.440 --> 03:36.560
I was too aggressive.

03:37.080 --> 03:38.200
I had no sense of limits.

03:38.720 --> 03:39.600
I overstepped my authority.

03:40.200 --> 03:41.080
Enough.

03:41.600 --> 03:42.760
All these years,

03:43.280 --> 03:45.400
I've spoiled you too much.

03:46.280 --> 03:49.000
From today on, stop taking cases.

03:49.640 --> 03:52.280
That Palace Investigation Bureau badge,
hand it over.

03:54.280 --> 03:55.120
Why should I?

03:55.720 --> 03:57.760
Because, as an Inner Guard,

03:57.840 --> 03:59.120
after you found the killer,

03:59.200 --> 04:01.880
you didn't bring her to justice at once.

04:01.960 --> 04:04.080
It looks like you were covering for her!

04:05.800 --> 04:08.920
At best, you neglected your duty.

04:09.000 --> 04:10.080
At worst,

04:10.160 --> 04:12.080
you bent the law for personal ties!

04:12.600 --> 04:13.800
Hand it over!

04:17.440 --> 04:18.959
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU BADGE

04:20.320 --> 04:22.000
But I didn't take Wanshun
out of the Western Capital.

04:23.480 --> 04:25.920
You didn't take the last wrong step

04:26.000 --> 04:28.880
because Her Highness
knew the bigger picture.

04:28.960 --> 04:31.560
If Her Highness had insisted on leaving,

04:32.160 --> 04:36.040
right now, would you already
be on a boat heading south?

04:37.920 --> 04:40.560
If every enforcer were like you,

04:41.160 --> 04:43.240
how could the law work?

04:43.760 --> 04:45.560
Today someone covers for you,

04:45.640 --> 04:47.720
tomorrow you cover for them,

04:47.800 --> 04:49.720
and the law becomes meaningless!

04:51.760 --> 04:53.680
If I've done wrong,
I'll take my punishment.

04:55.200 --> 04:56.280
But she's Wanshun.

04:56.360 --> 04:58.000
She must face justice too!

05:00.000 --> 05:01.320
People aren't made of wood.

05:01.840 --> 05:02.800
Who can be without feelings?

05:04.920 --> 05:07.400
But you're the one enforcing the law.

05:08.160 --> 05:10.640
To rule and punish,
you can't shield your kin.

05:11.240 --> 05:14.120
Your duty is to find the truth,

05:14.200 --> 05:16.040
not judge right and wrong.

05:16.120 --> 05:19.440
If you can't even understand that,

05:20.120 --> 05:23.040
you can't shoulder this badge anymore!

05:26.760 --> 05:29.640
I know you reported everything truthfully.

05:29.720 --> 05:30.920
From here on,

05:31.000 --> 05:33.440
let His Majesty decide.

05:33.520 --> 05:36.440
ZICHEN HALL

05:43.840 --> 05:45.400
Heed His Majesty's decree!

05:50.360 --> 05:52.480
"Left General
of the Imperial Guards, Lin Ning,

05:52.560 --> 05:54.840
lusted after Princess Ningyuan's beauty

05:54.920 --> 05:57.640
and secretly bought black powder
to stage an accident.

05:57.720 --> 05:59.960
He took advantage of the chaos
to kidnap Her Highness,

06:00.040 --> 06:02.000
but Cui Manshu,
niece of the Right Chancellor,

06:02.080 --> 06:06.040
and several others
stumbled upon it by chance.

06:06.120 --> 06:10.080
Lin Ning saw his plot exposed
and brutally killed them.

06:10.160 --> 06:12.080
He fled in fear of punishment.

06:12.160 --> 06:14.080
Princess of Fuchang County, Li Peiyi,

06:14.160 --> 06:17.720
and Deputy Director of Astronomy,
Xiao Huaijin, saw it all clearly

06:17.800 --> 06:20.720
and killed him as he fled.

06:20.800 --> 06:24.280
You two acted without hesitation,
brave and smart.

06:24.360 --> 06:26.360
Princess Ningyuan was quick-witted

06:26.440 --> 06:27.800
and escaped safely.

06:27.880 --> 06:29.520
All shall be rewarded."

06:29.600 --> 06:30.720
Accept the decree!

06:30.800 --> 06:32.240
Thank you, Your Majesty,
for your kindness.

06:37.120 --> 06:39.160
Her Highness is still recovering.

06:39.240 --> 06:40.120
In three days,

06:40.200 --> 06:41.880
His Majesty will host
a banquet at Penglai Terrace

06:41.960 --> 06:43.160
in Her Highness's honor.

06:43.760 --> 06:45.680
You two may come as well.

06:45.760 --> 06:46.960
- Understood.
- Understood.

07:03.440 --> 07:04.520
Stop!

07:11.880 --> 07:14.160
Come. Come to my side.

07:24.040 --> 07:26.080
PENGLAI TERRACE

07:33.040 --> 07:34.680
Please, Your Highness.

07:41.640 --> 07:43.360
I'm sorry to worry you, Father.

07:45.080 --> 07:46.040
Come.

07:53.400 --> 07:54.240
Wanshun.

07:55.520 --> 07:58.760
I know you were wronged. I know it all.

08:02.600 --> 08:03.520
Father…

08:06.200 --> 08:07.960
You're so generous and kind,

08:08.720 --> 08:10.640
yet for my own selfish gain,

08:11.160 --> 08:12.840
I stirred up such chaos.

08:15.600 --> 08:17.000
My child, you've suffered.

08:18.160 --> 08:21.440
I won't let any child of mine be wronged.

08:22.440 --> 08:25.800
I'll prepare another
generous dowry for you,

08:25.880 --> 08:28.600
so you'll marry in peace,

08:29.200 --> 08:30.120
with no worries.

08:34.880 --> 08:37.200
Congratulations, Princess Ningyuan!

08:37.760 --> 08:41.600
Your Majesty, what boundless favor!

08:41.679 --> 08:44.400
In Uyghur,

08:44.480 --> 08:45.880
Her Highness will be

08:45.960 --> 08:48.680
the most honored, noblest queen.

08:52.960 --> 08:54.680
Thank you, Father.

08:58.640 --> 08:59.840
Don't be rash.

09:03.320 --> 09:04.600
Please withdraw your order, Your Majesty.

09:08.240 --> 09:10.280
Wanshun is a daughter of my Li family,

09:10.360 --> 09:11.680
a princess of Great Tang.

09:12.280 --> 09:14.360
If your father and mother
were still alive,

09:14.960 --> 09:17.160
they'd surely explain the sense of it all.

09:17.800 --> 09:19.600
But since they're gone,

09:20.120 --> 09:21.760
I don't have to understand it.

09:24.880 --> 09:26.040
Peiyi.

09:26.120 --> 09:27.400
Your Majesty,

09:27.480 --> 09:29.960
Her Highness was blessed by your grace
and turned disaster into luck.

09:30.040 --> 09:33.600
Her match with Prince Wutele

09:33.680 --> 09:35.840
is fated to be.

09:35.920 --> 09:37.040
Peiyi…

09:39.000 --> 09:40.960
Let me speak to His Majesty myself.

09:44.440 --> 09:46.120
Your Majesty, if you're still in the mood,

09:47.000 --> 09:48.640
may I offer a dance,

09:49.320 --> 09:52.440
the Zhezhi Dance
Mother once performed for you,

09:53.240 --> 09:54.400
to thank your grace?

10:06.960 --> 10:09.280
PENGLAI TERRACE

11:31.040 --> 11:32.320
For 18 years,

11:33.040 --> 11:35.880
I never had the chance to speak with you.

11:36.520 --> 11:37.640
Today is a rare opportunity.

11:38.160 --> 11:40.320
I want to say what's in my heart.

11:41.440 --> 11:42.720
Or later,

11:43.960 --> 11:45.800
I may never get the chance.

11:48.560 --> 11:52.480
I'm lucky to be your daughter.

11:53.560 --> 11:55.240
But my luck is also limited.

11:56.080 --> 11:57.560
In 18 years,

11:58.960 --> 12:00.920
you only saw me three times.

12:03.600 --> 12:04.720
The first time,

12:05.680 --> 12:07.200
I was still little.

12:08.360 --> 12:11.080
You were checking
the princes' and princesses' lessons.

12:11.680 --> 12:13.280
You praised me for my talent,

12:15.000 --> 12:16.680
so I studied hard.

12:21.480 --> 12:23.120
From then on,

12:24.920 --> 12:28.520
I never had another chance
to show you my work.

12:36.280 --> 12:37.520
The second time,

12:38.640 --> 12:40.160
at your birthday banquet,

12:41.200 --> 12:44.000
I embroidered for you
"Dragon Soars Across the Seas."

12:44.880 --> 12:46.600
You praised it greatly

12:47.560 --> 12:48.480
and finally remembered

12:49.200 --> 12:51.600
you had a daughter
born of a desert dancer.

12:53.640 --> 12:55.120
So I kept improving my embroidery.

12:59.880 --> 13:00.800
Your Highness, please.

13:07.440 --> 13:09.120
Your embroidery has gotten even better.

13:09.200 --> 13:11.560
Give it to His Majesty
before the spring hunt.

13:11.640 --> 13:12.640
He will surely be pleased.

13:14.200 --> 13:15.280
But my patterns

13:17.640 --> 13:20.760
never had another chance
to be shown to you.

13:24.560 --> 13:25.880
The third time

13:27.800 --> 13:29.080
was this betrothal.

13:31.800 --> 13:33.080
This might be

13:34.160 --> 13:36.600
the best fate for me…

13:38.520 --> 13:40.360
as your daughter.

14:12.520 --> 14:13.720
But it's not so bad.

14:15.040 --> 14:16.120
Father,

14:17.400 --> 14:19.120
you won't forget me again.

14:27.600 --> 14:28.800
- Wanshun!
- Your Highness!

14:43.040 --> 14:43.880
Wanshun?

14:49.880 --> 14:50.760
Wanshun…

14:54.440 --> 14:55.560
Peiyi…

14:56.640 --> 14:58.000
You're so stupid.

14:59.520 --> 15:00.600
Why would you do this?

15:00.680 --> 15:01.800
Because…

15:03.080 --> 15:04.360
this way…

15:05.280 --> 15:09.240
no one can force me again
to do what I don't want.

15:12.160 --> 15:15.640
PENGLAI TERRACE

15:49.960 --> 15:50.920
Stop acting.

15:51.000 --> 15:53.040
Who keeps staring at a flower all day?

15:53.960 --> 15:55.280
His Majesty didn't see you.

15:55.360 --> 15:57.440
Those palace maids didn't see you either.

15:57.520 --> 15:58.960
You just tripped.

15:59.040 --> 16:00.320
Don't mind it.

16:02.400 --> 16:03.840
But it's fine.

16:03.920 --> 16:06.120
I saw it all, every bit.

16:16.240 --> 16:17.440
His Majesty asked me to give you this.

16:22.560 --> 16:24.520
Since you already finished
that horseback piece,

16:25.040 --> 16:26.200
why didn't you tell me sooner?

16:27.240 --> 16:29.800
Then I could help you get it
to His Majesty before the spring hunt.

16:29.880 --> 16:31.000
He would surely want to see you.

16:31.800 --> 16:32.880
It wasn't well done.

16:33.400 --> 16:34.240
Next time.

16:39.720 --> 16:42.160
These gold bangles are the prettiest.

16:43.160 --> 16:44.000
One for you, one for me.

16:47.000 --> 16:48.200
I hope someday

16:49.280 --> 16:51.200
we'll meet again.

17:24.359 --> 17:25.839
The ones who killed Wanshun…

17:28.800 --> 17:30.600
Lin Ning is one.

17:31.800 --> 17:33.640
Cui Manshu is one.

17:36.000 --> 17:37.320
I'm one.

17:41.520 --> 17:42.840
And…

17:43.440 --> 17:44.680
Who else?

17:47.600 --> 17:48.440
Your Majesty,

17:48.960 --> 17:50.560
the county princess
has been tirelessly working.

17:50.640 --> 17:51.800
And she lost her closest friend today,

17:51.880 --> 17:52.920
overcome with grief.

17:53.000 --> 17:55.480
Please allow her to rest for a few days.

18:13.160 --> 18:14.680
His Majesty is considerate.

18:14.760 --> 18:16.120
Your Ladyship, rest well.

18:16.200 --> 18:18.120
Stay away from the hall,

18:18.720 --> 18:21.320
or seeing things there
will stir old feelings

18:21.400 --> 18:22.960
and make you upset again.

18:36.680 --> 18:40.000
ZICHEN HALL

18:40.080 --> 18:42.320
VIRTUE SHINING, EVER-PROGRESSING

18:44.600 --> 18:46.560
Your Majesty, the matter
you ordered has a lead.

18:54.720 --> 18:55.600
Speak closer.

18:57.040 --> 18:59.000
A STAR HAS APPEARED IN THE GIRL MANSION
IT IS A MOST OMINOUS SIGN

18:59.080 --> 19:01.240
ON THE WUWU DAY OF THE FIRST MONTH
THE STAR HAS APPEARED

19:02.520 --> 19:05.360
This paper was found
in Princess Ningyuan's residence.

19:13.840 --> 19:16.400
Wanshun must have been misled
by that traitor Lin Ning

19:16.480 --> 19:17.840
to come up with such a foolish move.

19:19.720 --> 19:22.520
Lin Ning could move freely in the palace.

19:23.760 --> 19:25.560
Getting a secret memorial into the palace

19:26.080 --> 19:27.440
was not difficult task.

19:40.440 --> 19:42.120
Now that Wanshun has passed,

19:42.880 --> 19:43.920
has the omen come true?

19:45.320 --> 19:47.000
I dare not presume Heaven's will.

19:47.080 --> 19:49.200
But it seems this matter
doesn't involve the former dynasty.

19:49.280 --> 19:50.920
Your Majesty needn't worry.

20:00.840 --> 20:05.080
TANG

20:17.720 --> 20:19.840
PRINCESS ZHAOYUAN

20:38.840 --> 20:41.320
Wanshun paid with her life
to escape that road.

20:42.200 --> 20:44.040
In the end, someone still has to walk it.

20:48.840 --> 20:51.240
There's something
I must confess to Your Ladyship.

20:53.320 --> 20:54.480
Before the banquet that day,

20:55.000 --> 20:56.240
I met the Fifteenth Princess.

20:58.280 --> 20:59.600
Greetings, Your Highness.

21:05.360 --> 21:06.240
Deputy Director Xiao,

21:07.000 --> 21:08.440
I have a question.

21:09.360 --> 21:10.280
I wouldn't dare.

21:11.000 --> 21:14.240
Do you think the stars above

21:15.120 --> 21:17.040
can truly foretell human affairs?

21:20.040 --> 21:22.480
I only know the stars
don't cause conflicts.

21:22.560 --> 21:25.240
But people use star omens
to stir up trouble.

21:26.240 --> 21:27.960
Then, in your view,

21:28.480 --> 21:30.360
was the chaos of the Lantern Festival

21:31.040 --> 21:32.600
caused by an omen

21:32.680 --> 21:34.760
or by people fabricating one?

21:36.640 --> 21:38.360
Every matter has its reason

21:38.440 --> 21:39.840
and a whole story behind it.

21:39.920 --> 21:42.440
Your Highness being safe
is what matters most.

21:44.000 --> 21:45.240
So you already knew.

21:45.320 --> 21:48.000
Looks like you don't believe in fate.

21:48.080 --> 21:49.240
I do.

21:51.360 --> 21:52.880
But we mortals

21:52.960 --> 21:54.560
can see what fate looks like

21:54.640 --> 21:56.240
only at the end of life.

22:01.440 --> 22:02.360
Thank you.

22:06.760 --> 22:08.760
You saw that secret memorial?

22:11.600 --> 22:14.760
You must've guessed
it was me and the Princess together.

22:14.840 --> 22:16.520
At the Princess's residence,

22:16.600 --> 22:18.520
I found clues
tied to that secret memorial.

22:19.960 --> 22:21.400
But the Princess alone

22:21.480 --> 22:24.560
couldn't have gotten that memorial
into His Majesty's study.

22:25.520 --> 22:28.080
It's a pity that even after seeing
such a dire omen,

22:28.920 --> 22:30.720
His Majesty still
wouldn't change his mind.

22:35.200 --> 22:36.520
Congratulations, Deputy Director Xiao.

22:36.600 --> 22:37.760
Why congratulate me?

22:37.840 --> 22:40.080
Back then, you agreed
to help me with the case

22:40.680 --> 22:42.080
because you wanted the chance

22:42.160 --> 22:44.400
to help His Majesty find
who delivered the secret memorial.

22:44.480 --> 22:46.320
Now the Princess's case is solved.

22:46.400 --> 22:49.000
The matter you wanted to check
is clear as day.

22:49.080 --> 22:50.120
Isn't that worth celebrating?

22:50.720 --> 22:52.000
His Majesty believes

22:52.080 --> 22:54.760
this was all Lin Ning
talking the Princess into it.

22:59.400 --> 23:00.240
Mr. Xiao.

23:02.240 --> 23:03.640
Law and loyalty…

23:04.160 --> 23:05.320
How can you have both?

23:05.400 --> 23:07.840
The law is where rule begins.

23:08.360 --> 23:10.440
A gentleman is where rule is rooted.

23:13.480 --> 23:14.920
I'm odd and unruly.

23:15.440 --> 23:16.280
I'm no gentleman.

23:17.000 --> 23:18.440
But I'm no villain either.

23:19.040 --> 23:20.560
I don't really know you,

23:20.640 --> 23:21.760
so I can't judge,

23:21.840 --> 23:22.760
and I won't accuse you.

23:24.800 --> 23:27.320
Farmers have their hardships.

23:27.400 --> 23:29.560
People in the deep palace have theirs.

23:30.080 --> 23:31.840
I just had a bit of luck,

23:32.440 --> 23:33.760
played a few clever tricks,

23:34.280 --> 23:36.480
won a little favor,
and only then stood back up.

23:38.920 --> 23:40.720
Wanshun was another me.

23:42.840 --> 23:44.600
A me who never stood back up.

23:49.400 --> 23:51.840
His Majesty has ordered a lavish burial
for the Fifteenth Princess.

23:51.920 --> 23:53.760
Posthumous title, Zhaosi.

23:54.560 --> 23:56.360
His Majesty still cherished
the Fifteenth Princess.

23:56.440 --> 23:59.680
You and I both know what "cherish" means.

24:03.160 --> 24:05.080
"Soaring past clouds,

24:05.720 --> 24:07.560
the soul ascends."

24:07.640 --> 24:08.800
Good thing

24:09.320 --> 24:11.320
she's already gone
to the place she wanted.

24:17.160 --> 24:19.320
You're not a cold, rigid man of law.

24:20.840 --> 24:23.120
I know that when
you came back from the temple,

24:24.080 --> 24:25.400
you didn't go to see His Majesty.

24:39.840 --> 24:43.400
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

24:53.160 --> 24:55.840
XIAO

25:17.000 --> 25:19.840
XIAO'S MANSION

25:21.200 --> 25:24.480
Huaijin is usually on duty
at the Astronomical Bureau

25:25.000 --> 25:26.240
and rarely comes home.

25:26.880 --> 25:30.040
Looks like you came for nothing.

25:31.560 --> 25:32.400
It's fine.

25:32.920 --> 25:35.600
The cakes you made
are even better than the palace ones.

25:35.680 --> 25:36.520
I didn't come for nothing.

25:37.240 --> 25:40.120
Your Ladyship, so you like touhua cakes?

25:42.040 --> 25:44.040
When I was little, I'd throw a fit.

25:44.120 --> 25:46.120
Only touhua cakes could cheer me up.

25:46.640 --> 25:47.560
They're soft, sweet.

25:47.640 --> 25:48.680
One bite and I'd feel right.

25:48.760 --> 25:50.200
Then I'd calm right down.

25:52.720 --> 25:56.280
Madam, your scent
is different from Mr. Xiao's sachet.

25:58.040 --> 25:59.360
That kind of sachet

25:59.440 --> 26:01.680
was made just for him and his father.

26:01.760 --> 26:05.560
My own incense is mostly floral.

26:07.240 --> 26:08.840
You make your own incense?

26:10.520 --> 26:11.640
Bring me my incense.

26:34.760 --> 26:37.320
None of these are what Mr. Xiao uses.

26:37.400 --> 26:40.040
They've used theirs up,
and I haven't made more yet.

26:40.720 --> 26:43.720
These scents
don't include the one you like?

26:43.800 --> 26:47.080
In Mr. Xiao's sachet,
there are sandalwood and myrrh.

26:47.160 --> 26:48.000
I really like it.

26:48.760 --> 26:52.240
Princess Consort of Duan
also likes men's incense.

26:54.520 --> 26:57.080
Your Ladyship is so dashing.

26:57.160 --> 27:00.400
You really do look like her in her youth.

27:02.520 --> 27:03.800
I misspoke.

27:04.320 --> 27:05.240
I've offended you.

27:05.880 --> 27:08.520
Please forgive me.

27:09.440 --> 27:12.520
The case at my home
15 years ago was too tragic.

27:13.040 --> 27:14.120
It's no secret.

27:15.040 --> 27:16.320
But these 15 years,

27:16.920 --> 27:18.600
everyone's been afraid to offend me.

27:19.120 --> 27:21.600
So, about my parents,
they all keep it hush-hush.

27:22.200 --> 27:24.840
I thought no one remembered Prince of Duan
or his consort anymore.

27:26.160 --> 27:28.440
Hearing you praise my mother just now,

27:28.520 --> 27:29.720
I'm truly comforted.

27:32.440 --> 27:33.880
Madam, don't be so stiff.

27:34.400 --> 27:36.840
I'd actually like to hear more
about my father and my mother.

27:39.880 --> 27:41.280
When I was young,

27:42.000 --> 27:43.680
I met Princess Consort of Duan once

27:44.200 --> 27:46.520
at the Shangsi Festival.

27:46.600 --> 27:48.040
Her Highness

27:48.560 --> 27:49.760
was stunning,

27:49.840 --> 27:51.800
bright and bold.

27:51.880 --> 27:53.200
Unforgettable at first sight.

27:53.280 --> 27:56.720
Prince of Duan was brave in battle,

27:56.800 --> 27:58.280
his name known far and wide.

27:59.120 --> 28:00.280
Heaven…

28:01.560 --> 28:03.360
is always so unfair.

28:05.840 --> 28:06.800
Yes.

28:07.680 --> 28:09.160
From that Lantern Festival on,

28:09.680 --> 28:11.640
I could never reunite
with my parents again.

28:13.920 --> 28:15.920
That Lantern Festival,

28:16.720 --> 28:17.600
Huaijin

28:18.320 --> 28:21.760
was on night duty
at the Astronomical Bureau

28:22.280 --> 28:23.360
and didn't come home.

28:23.960 --> 28:27.600
My husband and I
kept Old Madam Xiao company.

28:27.680 --> 28:30.280
She was used to keeping vigil
and chanting sutras

28:30.360 --> 28:32.120
during the Lantern Festival.

28:32.920 --> 28:34.840
She only slept after midnight.

28:36.040 --> 28:38.760
That night, my husband
had official business,

28:38.840 --> 28:40.920
but to honor his filial duty,

28:41.440 --> 28:44.840
he stayed with Old Madam
through the Zi hour,

28:44.920 --> 28:46.280
then hurried out.

28:49.360 --> 28:50.480
The Zi hour?

28:52.880 --> 28:56.120
Early the next morning,
my husband came home.

28:56.200 --> 28:57.680
Only then did I learn

28:57.760 --> 28:59.520
something terrible had happened.

29:05.480 --> 29:07.400
I was too young back then.

29:07.920 --> 29:09.480
I don't remember that night at all.

29:10.160 --> 29:13.440
For some things, to forget

29:14.360 --> 29:15.920
is a blessing in itself.

29:31.040 --> 29:31.880
Move.

29:35.600 --> 29:38.040
So you finally visited the Xiao's mansion.

29:39.600 --> 29:40.760
How else would I find the killer?

29:41.640 --> 29:44.120
If you can find the killer here,

29:44.200 --> 29:45.480
I'll call you Master.

29:46.640 --> 29:47.800
Why can't I?

29:48.480 --> 29:49.880
So you really are
hiding something from me!

29:51.200 --> 29:52.160
Yes.

29:52.240 --> 29:55.000
I hid it from you.
I drank great wine at Zuixian House.

29:55.840 --> 29:59.200
And I ate a plate
of top-notch braised lamb.

30:02.800 --> 30:04.040
So what did you find?

30:07.040 --> 30:09.400
Looks like you found nothing.

30:10.120 --> 30:11.000
My guess is,

30:11.080 --> 30:12.840
on the Lantern Festival night
15 years ago,

30:12.920 --> 30:16.720
they haven't sent anyone
to visit your family.

30:18.720 --> 30:20.960
Clearing suspicion is still a gain.

30:22.360 --> 30:23.360
Peiyi,

30:24.160 --> 30:25.680
let it go.

30:25.760 --> 30:29.560
Clinging too hard makes you see
enemies everywhere and clouds your mind.

30:29.640 --> 30:33.600
What was clear and simple
will turn hard to grasp.

30:35.360 --> 30:37.600
But if I can't even trust myself,

30:40.640 --> 30:42.120
who can I trust?

30:55.280 --> 30:56.400
Don't worry.

30:57.800 --> 30:59.360
Whatever I said back then,

31:00.640 --> 31:03.440
today I'll say the same.

31:05.280 --> 31:06.480
Do you think

31:08.240 --> 31:09.560
she truly forgot?

31:11.720 --> 31:13.880
She is sharp and quick.

31:14.720 --> 31:15.880
She came today

31:16.480 --> 31:19.480
for more than just liking that incense.

31:20.080 --> 31:23.640
If she remembers,
we must find a way to handle it.

31:24.240 --> 31:26.040
If she doesn't…

31:26.120 --> 31:27.560
We must stop her from remembering.

31:30.080 --> 31:32.200
If she doesn't get
the answers she wants here,

31:32.720 --> 31:34.040
she likely won't come again.

31:36.480 --> 31:38.000
Thank you, Mother.

31:38.080 --> 31:39.240
I'm going back to the Astronomical Bureau.

31:40.320 --> 31:42.280
Your father will be back soon.

31:42.800 --> 31:45.280
- See him before you go.
- No need.

31:46.160 --> 31:49.040
And today's matter
needn't be told to Father.

31:51.840 --> 31:53.040
I'll be going now.

32:01.120 --> 32:03.320
SPRING OF THE 13TH, YEAR OF DALI

32:03.400 --> 32:04.840
XINGQING PALACE

32:13.880 --> 32:17.440
So there really are
such special flowers in this world.

32:18.040 --> 32:19.960
I thought it was an exaggeration.

32:27.240 --> 32:28.400
Your Majesty, look.

32:29.200 --> 32:30.200
When the breeze blows,

32:30.880 --> 32:32.240
they glimmer with light.

32:32.320 --> 32:34.000
Like droplets of water.

32:35.760 --> 32:39.640
They aren't like the peony,
so grand and noble, so bold and open.

32:39.720 --> 32:41.480
But they're delicate and enchanting.

32:43.760 --> 32:46.880
And their scent is faint, yet there.

32:46.960 --> 32:48.920
It makes you want to lean in.

32:49.440 --> 32:51.360
No wonder they're called "Hundred Charms."

33:07.920 --> 33:10.920
Your Majesty,
this lady truly is so beautiful

33:11.000 --> 33:14.120
that it shames the moon and flowers.

33:15.520 --> 33:18.000
These flowers should be given to a beauty.

33:18.760 --> 33:21.560
This servant will pick them
for you at once!

33:38.640 --> 33:41.240
The wall!
There's something inside the wall!

33:44.560 --> 33:45.600
Your Majesty!

33:57.240 --> 33:57.960
- Your Majesty!
- Hurry!

33:58.040 --> 33:59.400
Get Consort Shu back to her palace, now!

33:59.480 --> 34:00.560
Get Consort Shu back to her palace!

34:00.640 --> 34:01.720
I deserve death!

34:01.800 --> 34:03.760
I deserve death!

34:08.120 --> 34:11.280
In Xingqing Palace, such cruelty happened!

34:11.880 --> 34:14.080
Summon the Palace Investigation Bureau
to thoroughly investigate it!

34:14.679 --> 34:17.080
This servant obeys!

34:27.560 --> 34:29.560
Thanks for covering for me,
Deputy Director Xiao.

34:30.159 --> 34:32.920
That robe… Let me burn it for you.

34:33.639 --> 34:34.480
Much obliged.

34:36.520 --> 34:37.560
Hurry!

34:59.200 --> 35:02.120
FLOWER ON THE WALL

35:11.720 --> 35:13.120
Your Ladyship,

35:13.200 --> 35:15.520
you just got your post back.
Don't do anything rash.

35:15.600 --> 35:17.440
By the order of His Majesty,
you are forbidden to examine the body.

35:18.040 --> 35:20.400
Keep your voice down.
Then no one will know.

35:22.480 --> 35:24.040
"Hundred Charms"?

35:24.600 --> 35:26.160
More like "demon charms."

35:27.040 --> 35:28.320
What did the Assistant Director here say?

35:28.960 --> 35:30.840
Tried to be clever, scared stiff,

35:30.920 --> 35:32.040
he couldn't say a word.

35:32.760 --> 35:34.120
Take him back.
We'll question him tomorrow.

35:34.200 --> 35:35.080
- Understood!
- Understood!

35:45.000 --> 35:46.040
Your Ladyship,

35:46.120 --> 35:48.440
I heard there's a man-eating flower
in the South Sea.

35:48.520 --> 35:51.000
Its seeds are tiny as sand, light as dust,

35:51.080 --> 35:52.240
hard to notice.

35:52.760 --> 35:54.760
If it lands on someone,
it takes root right away,

35:55.640 --> 35:58.040
feeding on flesh as soil,
marrow as fertilizer.

35:58.120 --> 36:00.000
By the time you notice,
it's already too late.

36:00.600 --> 36:02.560
You can only be drained alive

36:03.640 --> 36:04.640
and die in agony.

36:29.360 --> 36:30.280
Xiang embroidery…

36:30.920 --> 36:32.440
It must be from the palace.

36:33.040 --> 36:35.000
The seeds in the sachet sprouted,

36:35.800 --> 36:37.640
using the soil inside the wall
and the spring rain,

36:37.720 --> 36:39.160
and bloomed into flowers.

36:41.600 --> 36:42.840
Director of Embroidery, take a look.

36:42.920 --> 36:44.600
Is this stitching Xiang embroidery?

36:45.200 --> 36:46.880
Your Ladyship, it is Xiang embroidery.

36:46.960 --> 36:49.960
And workmanship like this
can only be Birou's.

36:50.040 --> 36:51.240
Get her out here.

36:51.320 --> 36:52.800
Birou isn't with
the Palace Workshop Service.

36:52.880 --> 36:54.000
She serves Talent Wang.

36:54.600 --> 36:55.760
Please wait.

36:59.920 --> 37:01.400
Your Ladyship, are you saying…

37:03.000 --> 37:05.720
the owner of this sachet is already dead?

37:05.800 --> 37:06.640
BIROU, PALACE MAID

37:12.760 --> 37:13.920
Your Ladyship,

37:14.960 --> 37:17.800
I gave this sachet to Hanxiao.

37:19.320 --> 37:21.760
Hanxiao from Consort Shu's palace?

37:23.840 --> 37:26.040
Did Hanxiao have any identifying marks?

37:26.120 --> 37:29.560
On the inside of both ankles,
she had cinnabar moles,

37:29.640 --> 37:32.640
perfectly symmetrical, very distinctive.

37:37.200 --> 37:38.280
Your Ladyship,

37:39.440 --> 37:41.080
did that body have them?

37:44.880 --> 37:46.960
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

37:47.040 --> 37:48.600
I found Hanxiao's exit record
in the Bureau of Palace Ladies,

37:48.680 --> 37:50.080
dated half a year ago.

37:50.160 --> 37:51.360
His Majesty cares for the palace maids.

37:51.440 --> 37:53.760
Every maid released
gets a resettlement payment,

37:53.840 --> 37:56.240
so they can marry and make a living.

37:56.320 --> 37:57.800
She already collected the money.

37:57.880 --> 38:00.160
Her exit date and household register
are all here.

38:04.280 --> 38:05.360
Chang'an County…

38:09.880 --> 38:11.320
Is this the Cai household?

38:11.400 --> 38:12.440
Yes.

38:15.280 --> 38:17.520
Miss, you're from the palace?

38:18.640 --> 38:20.280
Do you know my elder sister Hanxiao?

38:20.360 --> 38:21.960
So, you're Hanxiao's younger sister?

38:22.040 --> 38:23.480
Yes. My name's Zhenzhen.

38:24.000 --> 38:25.960
Miss, do you have any news of my sister?

38:26.520 --> 38:27.520
Who is it?

38:29.200 --> 38:31.320
Mother! They're from the palace!

38:33.680 --> 38:36.040
So, do you have any news of Hanxiao?

38:37.840 --> 38:41.240
Hanxiao was my best friend in the palace.

38:42.240 --> 38:44.520
After she left the palace, we lost touch.

38:44.600 --> 38:48.080
I came to Chang'an County on business
today, so I thought I'd check on her.

38:48.600 --> 38:49.840
How could she go missing?

38:52.080 --> 38:55.120
Outside the palace,
did she have anyone close?

38:55.200 --> 38:57.640
She never talked to us about that.

38:57.720 --> 38:59.480
So I don't know.

39:06.160 --> 39:08.400
Miss, I heard

39:09.000 --> 39:11.520
the court gives those leaving the palace

39:11.600 --> 39:13.000
a resettlement payment.

39:13.760 --> 39:14.920
Is that true?

39:15.520 --> 39:18.080
Of course. It's a lot of money.

39:18.160 --> 39:19.680
Then…

39:19.760 --> 39:21.720
can we… claim it?

39:24.520 --> 39:27.240
Why? Is your family short on money?

39:29.760 --> 39:31.480
My husband has been sickly.

39:31.560 --> 39:34.360
He can only mind a shop for others
and earns next to nothing.

39:35.080 --> 39:36.920
But everything costs money at home.

39:37.000 --> 39:39.080
Thankfully, we had Hanxiao.

39:39.160 --> 39:42.000
She landed a position in the palace
and supported us all.

39:42.080 --> 39:43.840
She was our backbone.

39:43.920 --> 39:45.880
If you rely on Hanxiao to support you,

39:45.960 --> 39:47.080
shouldn't you find her first?

39:49.240 --> 39:50.240
We…

39:50.760 --> 39:52.520
We will!

39:53.040 --> 39:55.960
But our whole family has to live, too.

39:57.800 --> 39:59.560
Madam, it's been so hard on you.

40:01.920 --> 40:04.640
This is all the money I have. Here.

40:05.200 --> 40:06.240
Oh…

40:08.720 --> 40:09.880
Well…

40:09.960 --> 40:12.960
I just don't know
where else to get news of Hanxiao.

40:15.520 --> 40:17.880
We have letters she sent before.

40:18.960 --> 40:20.600
Go get them, now! Hurry!

40:23.360 --> 40:25.240
The really old ones are gone.

40:25.760 --> 40:27.480
These are from the past two years,

40:27.560 --> 40:29.600
up until she went missing.

40:30.240 --> 40:31.400
I kept them all carefully.

40:32.320 --> 40:34.760
Miss, take a look. Maybe they'll help.

40:38.400 --> 40:39.320
I'll come again another day.

40:40.600 --> 40:42.400
If you remember anything else,

40:42.480 --> 40:43.560
tell me right away.

40:43.640 --> 40:45.280
Yes!

40:47.560 --> 40:49.640
Hanxiao was blessed to have friends

40:49.720 --> 40:51.200
like you two.

40:51.280 --> 40:52.480
Truly blessed!

41:06.400 --> 41:07.320
Miss!

41:09.320 --> 41:10.160
Miss!

41:11.080 --> 41:13.080
If you find my sister, please tell her

41:13.680 --> 41:14.880
I'm grown up now.

41:14.960 --> 41:17.200
I can fold 500 paper ingots
and earn one wen.

41:17.280 --> 41:18.600
I can help the household.

41:19.640 --> 41:21.400
She doesn't have to work so hard.

41:23.760 --> 41:24.960
And…

41:25.560 --> 41:27.520
if she really doesn't want to come back,

41:28.480 --> 41:29.320
then let her go.

41:30.920 --> 41:32.440
I won't beg her to return.

41:33.280 --> 41:34.680
I just want her safe.

41:49.800 --> 41:50.680
Hide it well.

41:50.760 --> 41:52.200
Don't let anyone find it.

41:52.720 --> 41:54.120
If your parents try
to send you into the palace

41:54.200 --> 41:55.440
or force you to marry,

41:55.520 --> 41:56.680
take this jade token

41:56.760 --> 41:58.240
to the Palace Investigation Bureau
in Xingqing Palace.

41:58.320 --> 41:59.280
Remember?

42:00.320 --> 42:03.000
Promise me,
and I'll help you find your sister.

42:05.960 --> 42:08.520
ZUIXIAN HOUSE

42:11.320 --> 42:12.720
Money for her father's medicine,

42:12.800 --> 42:13.960
money for her brother's schooling,

42:14.040 --> 42:15.600
money to fix the stove,

42:15.680 --> 42:17.520
money for coal and winter clothes…

42:17.600 --> 42:19.800
These letters are basically
about the family asking for money

42:19.880 --> 42:20.800
and Hanxiao sending money.

42:21.520 --> 42:23.600
That family is playing poor,
squeezing their daughter dry.

42:23.680 --> 42:25.280
You paid so much for these letters.

42:25.360 --> 42:27.400
You're encouraging
their habit of extortion.

42:28.760 --> 42:29.680
Look again.

42:29.760 --> 42:31.280
Do they say anything else?

42:31.920 --> 42:33.280
Where she'd go after leaving the palace,

42:33.360 --> 42:34.720
whether she needed
her parents to meet her, anything.

42:35.320 --> 42:36.880
There are lots still unopened.

42:36.960 --> 42:38.120
I'll read them one by one.

42:38.200 --> 42:40.200
Even if there is,
it's not worth that much.

42:41.880 --> 42:43.080
This lamb is so tender.

42:43.160 --> 42:44.360
Try some.

42:52.560 --> 42:55.760
What I gave Hanxiao's family
was tribute silver.

42:56.360 --> 42:58.640
The moment it hits the market,
someone will report it.

42:58.720 --> 43:00.640
The money will come back fast.

43:00.720 --> 43:03.040
So these letters didn't cost anything.

43:07.400 --> 43:09.600
I checked both the Capital Prefecture
and Chang'an County offices.

43:09.680 --> 43:11.680
In the past half year,
there's no record of Hanxiao registering.

43:13.680 --> 43:15.040
She left the palace,

43:15.120 --> 43:16.560
yet her body ended up back inside.

43:17.160 --> 43:19.640
Looks like the killer
can move freely in the palace,

43:19.720 --> 43:21.120
go anywhere without suspicion,

43:21.200 --> 43:22.720
and even come and go from the palace.

43:22.800 --> 43:25.040
What kind of status would that be?

43:25.120 --> 43:27.120
And they can hide a body in the harem.

43:28.600 --> 43:30.560
Mr. Xiao has the qilin badge.
He could do it.

43:33.360 --> 43:34.800
Or maybe it's not someone important,

43:34.880 --> 43:37.320
but someone low enough
that no one notices them.

43:39.320 --> 43:40.680
Did you spread the word I told you to?

43:40.760 --> 43:41.920
I did.

43:42.000 --> 43:43.440
Hanxiao got along with people.

43:43.520 --> 43:44.960
Hearing she died so horribly,

43:45.040 --> 43:46.520
some palace maid
will surely come with clues.

43:46.600 --> 43:49.560
Didn't His Majesty
order a quiet investigation

43:49.640 --> 43:51.000
to avoid panic?

43:52.000 --> 43:54.160
His Majesty also ordered we solve it fast.

43:57.720 --> 43:58.600
I'm done eating.

43:58.680 --> 44:00.120
Let's go back to the Palace
Investigation Bureau and wait.

44:01.880 --> 44:03.280
We already have a lead so soon.

44:05.600 --> 44:07.000
Your Ladyship, blessings.

44:07.560 --> 44:09.800
I'm Qingquan from Consort Shu's palace.

44:10.400 --> 44:11.240
I…

44:13.040 --> 44:15.040
I know who killed Hanxiao!
